  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen omfattar tre kurser i m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter f&#xf6;r instrukt&#xf6;rer vid polis- och milit&#xe4;rh&#xf6;gskolan, poliser p&#xe5; regional niv&#xe5; samt domare och &#xe5;klagare. Insatsen inkluderas i projektet &quot;St&#xf6;d till st&#xe4;rkande av Public Defender&apos;s Office&quot; (&#xd6;st 393/98)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project comprises human rights training for key officers of the law enforcement and the judiciary. This forms part of the broader project &quot;support and strenthening of the Public Defender&apos;s Office&quot; (&#xd6;ST_393/98).</narrative>
  </description>
